rvices be selected for different types of spaces?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"Yes, interior design services are available for various residential and commercial spaces. Services can be chosen based on the purpose and requirements of each project.\"\n    }\n  }]\n}\n</script>\n    <style>\n        /* New Warm & Elegant Theme Colors */\n        :root {\n            --bg-color: #f4f1ee; /* Warm Off-White */\n            --text-color: #5a5349; /* Warm Gray/Brown Body Text */\n            --heading-color: #4a433a; /* Darker Warm Gray/Brown Headings */\n            --accent-color: #8b8173; /* Muted Khaki/Taupe Accent */\n            --font-serif: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;\n            --font-sans: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;\n\n            /* Existing non-color variables kept for structure */\n            --shadow-subtle: 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\n            --border-radius: 12px;\n        }\n\n        /* General Styles */\n        body {\n            font-family: var(--font-sans);\n            background-color: var(--bg-color);\n            color: var(--text-color);\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n        .container {\n            width: 100%;\n            padding: 0 20px;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n        h1, h2, h3 {\n            font-family: var(--font-serif);\n            font-weight: 700;\n            line-height: 1.1;\n            margin-top: 0;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        p {\n            font-weight: 400;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n        }\n        b, strong {\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        section {\n            padding: 60px 0;\n        }\n        \n        /* --- Hero Section --- */\n        .hero-section {\n            background-image: url('/img/bbb4.avif'); \n            background-size: cover;\n            background-position: center center;\n            position: relative; \n            overflow: hidden;\n            min-height: 400px;\n            color: var(--bg-color);\n            padding: 80px 20px 60px;\n            border-bottom-left-radius: 40px;\n            border-bottom-right-radius: 40px;\n            text-align: center;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            z-index: 1;\n        }\n        \n        .hero-section::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            right: 0;\n            bottom: 0;\n            background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n            z-index: 2;\n        }\n        \n        .hero-section .container {\n            position: relative;\n            z-index: 3;\n        }\n\n        .hero-section h1 {\n            font-size: clamp(36px, 8vw, 68px);\n            font-weight: 700;\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n            color: var(--bg-color);\n            text-shadow: none;\n        }\n        .hero-section p {\n            font-size: clamp(16px, 3vw, 24px);\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: var(--bg-color);\n            max-width: 800px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n\n        /* --- Content & Philosophy --- */\n        .content-wrap {\n            padding: 40px 0;\n            max-width: 1400px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n        .intro-text, .philosophy-box {\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n        .intro-text h2 {\n            font-size: clamp(26px, 3.5vw, 36px);\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n            line-height: 1.25;\n        }\n        .philosophy-box {\n            background-color: var(--bg-color);\n            border: 2px solid var(--accent-color);\n            padding: 30px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle